        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <a
            href="/blog/choosing-right-phone-size"
            class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow group border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
          >
            <div class="p-6">
              <span
                class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 rounded-full text-xs font-medium mb-3"
              >
                Phone Guide
              </span>
              <h3
                class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200 mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-600 dark:group-hover:text-amber-400"
              >
                How to Choose the Right Phone Size
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mb-3">
                Complete guide to selecting the perfect phone size based on hand
                size and usage needs.
              </p>
              <span
                class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm font-medium"
                >Read Guide →</span
              >
            </div>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/tv-screen-size-calculator"
            class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow group border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
